<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Detailed by Chels | Premium Mobile Automotive Aesthetics</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@300;400;600&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <style>
        :root {
            --deep-maroon: #5A192A;
            --rose-gold: #D4A3A9;
            --blush-pink: #F9ECEE;
            --charcoal: #231F20;
            --white: #FFFFFF;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            color: var(--charcoal);
            background-color: var(--white);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        h1, h2, h3 {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            color: var(--deep-maroon);
        }

        /* Navigation */
        nav {
            background-color: var(--white);
            padding: 15px 5%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--blush-pink);
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 1000;
        }

        nav img {
            height: 70px;
            width: auto;
        }

        /* Hero Section */
        .hero {
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(249, 236, 238, 0.85), rgba(249, 236, 238, 0.95)), url('car2.jpg') no-repeat center center/cover;
            padding: 100px 5% calc(100px + 2vw);
            text-align: center;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0 auto 30px;
            color: var(--charcoal);
            font-weight: 300;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: var(--deep-maroon);
            color: var(--white);
            padding: 15px 35px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            border: 2px solid var(--deep-maroon);
        }

        .btn:hover {
            background-color: transparent;
            color: var(--deep-maroon);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        /* The Hook / Intro */
        .intro {
            padding: 80px 10%;
            text-align: center;
            background-color: var(--white);
        }

        .intro h2 {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .intro p {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: #555;
            font-weight: 300;
        }

        /* Services Grid */
        .services {
            background-color: var(--blush-pink);
            padding: 80px 5%;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .services h2 {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .card {
            background-color: var(--white);
            padding: 40px 30px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(90, 25, 42, 0.05);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }

        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }

        .card h3 {
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .card .price {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--charcoal);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .card ul {
            list-style: none;
            text-align: left;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: #555;
        }

        .card ul li {
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            position: relative;
            padding-left: 25px;
        }

        .card ul li::before {
            content: "✦";
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            color: var(--rose-gold);
        }

        /* Gallery Section */
        .gallery {
            padding: 80px 5%;
            text-align: center;
            background-color: var(--white);
        }

        .gallery h2 {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .gallery-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .gallery-item {
            overflow: hidden;
            border-radius: 10px;
            height: 350px;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }

        .gallery-item img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            transition: transform 0.5s ease;
        }

        .gallery-item:hover img {
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }

        /* Contact Section */
        .contact {
            background-color: var(--blush-pink);
            padding: 80px 5%;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .contact h2 {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .contact p {
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            color: #555;
        }

        form {
            background-color: var(--white);
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            text-align: left;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);
        }

        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        label {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        input, select, textarea {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px;
            border: 1px solid #DDD;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            font-size: 1rem;
        }

        input:focus, select:focus, textarea:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: var(--rose-gold);
        }

        form .btn {
            width: 100%;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        footer {
            background-color: var(--charcoal);
            color: var(--white);
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px 5%;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 300;
        }

        /* Responsive Fixes */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .hero h1 { font-size: 2.2rem; }
            .intro { padding: 60px 5%; }
            form { padding: 25px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <nav>
        <img src="logo.png" alt="Detailed by Chels Logo">
    </nav>

    <section class="hero">
        <h1>Showroom Perfection.<br>Delivered to Your Door.</h1>
        <p>Premium mobile automotive aesthetics and cosmetic preservation. We operate a completely self-contained detailing studio on wheels—bringing flawless correction and protection straight to your driveway, sir.</p>
        <a href="#quote" class="btn">Get a Bespoke Quote</a>
    </section>

    <section class="intro">
        <h2>We Don't Just Wash Cars. We Restore Them.</h2>
        <p>Most local car washes use aggressive chemicals and contaminated wash mitts that inflict permanent swirl marks, scratches, and haze into your lacquer. <strong>Detailed by Chels</strong> treats your investment with absolute precision. Utilizing high-end multi-stage decontamination, ultra-pure water systems, and premium ceramic sealants, we lock in a deep, glassy mirror reflection that lasts, sir.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="services">
        <h2>The Detail Menus</h2>
        <div class="grid">
            
            <div class="card">
                <div>
                    <h3>The Maintenance</h3>
                    <p class="price">From £60</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Safe multi-stage pH-neutral hand wash</li>
                        <li>Deep wheel barrel and arch decontamination</li>
                        <li>Intense interior vacuum and dust extraction</li>
                        <li>Streak-free crystal glass clarity treatment</li>
                        <li>High-gloss spray sealant protection</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <a href="#quote" class="btn">Enquire</a>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <div>
                    <h3>The Full Detail</h3>
                    <p class="price">From £150</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Everything included in Maintenance package</li>
                        <li>Full chemical fallout and clay bar decontamination</li>
                        <li>Single-stage machine polish to erase light defects</li>
                        <li>Interior deep clean, steam sterilization & leather dress</li>
                        <li>Premium hand-applied hard wax protection layer</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <a href="#quote" class="btn">Enquire</a>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <div>
                    <h3>The Elite Ceramic</h3>
                    <p class="price">From £350</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Complete structural multi-stage paint correction</li>
                        <li>Elimination of major swirl marks and surface scratching</li>
                        <li>Full panel degrease and prep alignment</li>
                        <li>Ultra-hydrophobic professional multi-year Ceramic Coating</li>
                        <li>Unmatched self-cleaning properties and mirror depth</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <a href="#quote" class="btn">Enquire</a>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="gallery">
        <h2>Aesthetics In Progress</h2>
        <div class="gallery-grid">
            <div class="gallery-item"><img src="car4.jpg" alt="Thick active snow foam decontamination pre-wash stage"></div>
            <div class="gallery-item"><img src="car3.jpg" alt="Precision high pressure rinse on Ford Fiesta ST panels"></div>
            <div class="gallery-item"><img src="car1.jpg" alt="Mobile van setup prepping Mercedes executive sedan"></div>
            <div class="gallery-item"><img src="car2.jpg" alt="Flawless high gloss finish delivered on driveway"></div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="contact" id="quote">
        <h2>Request a Bespoke Quote</h2>
        <p>Tell Chelsea what machine you drive and what treatment it requires. She will tailor a custom quote specifically for your vehicle, sir.</p>
        
        <form action="https://formspree.io/f/placeholder" method="POST">
            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="name">Your Name</label>
                <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required placeholder="e.g. John Doe">
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="phone">Phone Number</label>
                <input type="tel" id="phone" name="phone" required placeholder="e.g. 07123 456789">
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="vehicle">Vehicle Make & Model</label>
                <input type="text" id="vehicle" name="vehicle" required placeholder="e.g. 2016 Mercedes A-Class Red">
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="service">Desired Service Tier</label>
                <select id="service" name="service">
                    <option value="maintenance">The Maintenance Detail</option>
                    <option value="full">The Full Detail Package</option>
                    <option value="elite">The Elite Ceramic Paint Correction</option>
                    <option value="custom">Custom Request / Not Sure</option>
                </select>
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="notes">Additional Requirements / Condition Details</label>
                <textarea id="notes" name="notes" rows="4" placeholder="Any specific issues like heavy pet hair, water spots, or deep scratches?"></textarea>
            </div>
            <button type="submit" class="btn">Submit Quote Request</button>
        </form>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 Detailed by Chels. All Rights Reserved. Fully Insured Mobile Valeting & Paint Correction Studio, sir.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
